{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, editorial-style Shopify section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference image as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not redesign, reinterpret, or change the layout. Reproduce the same two-column composition, image arrangement, typography, colours, spacing, proportions, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Background colour: warm ivory / pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired babywear aesthetic.
    
    Content maximum width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop section padding: 65px 55px.
    
    Two-column layout:
    
    Left content column: 46%.
    
    Right visual column: 54%.
    
    Vertically centre both columns.
    
    Use generous whitespace.
    
    Avoid unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – BRAND STORY
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    "— OUR STORY"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive green (#777D5D).
    
    Main heading:
    "For Every Kiss.
    For Every Cry."
    
    Font: Montserrat ExtraBold.
    
    Desktop font size: 40px.
    
    Line height: 1.05.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Preserve the two-line heading structure.
    
    First paragraph:
    
    "Kiss and Kry began with a simple belief: the very first things a baby wears should be the softest, kindest things they ever touch."
    
    Second paragraph:
    
    "So we chose bamboo, kept every design simple to dress and easy to love, and finished each piece with care. Considered essentials, made to bring a little more meaning to every day."
    
    Typography:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 12px.
    
    Line height: 1.65.
    
    Colour: soft grey olive (#858575).
    
    Paragraph spacing: 12px.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Brand signature:
    
    "With love, Team Kiss and Kry"
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    12px.
    
    Dark olive.
    
    Below it:
    
    "Thoughtfully made. For every comfort."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    10px.
    
    Muted olive.
    
    3. BRAND VALUES – THREE PILL BADGES
    
    Under the brand signature, create three small horizontally aligned pill-shaped badges.
    
    Badge 1:
    
    Small circular icon: sparkle / star.
    
    Text: "Thoughtfully made"
    
    Badge 2:
    
    Small circular icon: leaf.
    
    Text: "Bamboo viscose"
    
    Badge 3:
    
    Small circular icon: heart.
    
    Text: "Everyday comfort"
    
    Design:
    
    Background: white / warm off-white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Thin subtle border.
    
    Small circular icon background in pale beige.
    
    Icon colour: muted olive.
    
    Text colour: dark olive.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium, 9px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 12px.
    
    Vertical padding: 7px.
    
    Gap: 8px.
    
    Keep all three badges on one line on desktop., 4. RIGHT COLUMN – IMAGE COLLAGE
    
    This is the most important visual element.
    
    Create an asymmetrical, overlapping three-element composition exactly like the reference.
    
    Image 1 – Top large image
    
    Position: upper-right.
    
    Landscape orientation.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 440px × 205px.
    
    Border radius: 18px.
    
    Show a close-up photograph of a happy baby wearing a mustard-yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby's face and upper body should be clearly visible.
    
    Natural, soft lighting.
    
    Warm neutral background.
    
    Object-fit: cover.
    
    Image 2 – Bottom-left overlapping image
    
    Position: below the first image, slightly towards the left.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 245px × 225px.
    
    Square-ish portrait crop.
    
    Border radius: 12px.
    
    Overlap the lower-left portion of the top image.
    
    Show a baby wearing a soft yellow bamboo outfit, lying comfortably on a fluffy cream blanket.
    
    Natural lifestyle photography.
    
    Warm, soft, premium appearance.
    
    Add a clean white border of approximately 5px around the image.
    
    Image 3 – Bottom-right brand quote card
    
    Position: bottom-right, beside the smaller baby image.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 250px × 150px.
    
    Background: dark olive green (#626B4C).
    
    Border radius: 16px.
    
    Padding: 24px.
    
    Align text to the left.
    
    Quote card content:
    
    Large decorative quotation mark:
    "“"
    
    Quote:
    "As gentle as a first kiss. As comforting as a hug after every cry."
    
    Attribution:
    "THE KISS AND KRY PROMISE"
    
    Styling:
    
    Quotation mark: mustard yellow (#E7B13A), 30px, bold.
    
    Quote: warm ivory (#F5F3E7), Montserrat SemiBold, 15px.
    
    Line height: 1.4.
    
    Attribution: Montserrat Medium, 8px.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted cream.
    
    5. EXACT POSITIONING
    
    Desktop composition must follow this structure:
    
    LEFT:
    
    Eyebrow.
    
    Main two-line heading.
    
    Two paragraphs.
    
    Brand signature.
    
    Three value pills.
    
    RIGHT:
    
    Large landscape baby image at the top.
    
    Smaller square baby image overlapping beneath it on the left.
    
    Dark olive quote card positioned beneath it on the right.
    
    The three visual elements must form a balanced asymmetrical collage.
    
    Do not arrange the images in a regular grid.
    Do not place the quote card above or below both images.
    Do not remove the overlapping image effect., 6. COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use only this brand palette:
    
    Main background: #F5F3E7
    
    Dark olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Body text: #858575
    
    White: #FFFFFF
    
    Accent mustard: #E7B13A
    
    Pale beige: #EAE5D4
    
    7. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat throughout.
    
    Main heading: Montserrat ExtraBold.
    
    Subheadings: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Body text: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Eyebrow: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Labels: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Maintain a premium editorial typography hierarchy.
    
    8. RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOUR
    
    Desktop:
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Text on left and collage on right.
    
    Preserve all image overlaps and proportions.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Reduce column spacing.
    
    Scale images proportionally.
    
    Keep the two-column structure wherever possible.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack content vertically.
    
    Text section first.
    
    Image collage below.
    
    Maintain the overlapping image composition.
    
    Keep the quote card visible.
    
    Reduce heading to 30px.
    
    Body text 12px.
    
    Pills can wrap onto a second line.
    
    Ensure no horizontal overflow.
    
    Add 22px horizontal padding.
    
    9. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Include editable schema settings for:
    
    Eyebrow text.
    
    Main heading.
    
    First paragraph.
    
    Second paragraph.
    
    Signature text.
    
    Signature subtitle.
    
    All three value badge labels and icons.
    
    Main baby image.
    
    Secondary baby image.
    
    Quote text.
    
    Quote attribution.
    
    Background colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Body text colour.
    
    Quote card background.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Image dimensions.
    
    Image corner radius.
    
    Allow merchants to upload and replace both baby photographs directly from the Shopify theme editor.
    
    Use image_picker settings for both images.
    
    Use inline SVG icons or lightweight CSS icons.
    
    Use semantic HTML and clean CSS.
    
    Ensure compatibility with modern Shopify 2.0 themes.
    
    Do not use external libraries or unnecessary JavaScript.
    
    Do not modify any existing theme sections.
    
    , make all the text in this section as rich text, fix the badges perfectly might look good and professionally made and perfectly aligned
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent | default: 100 }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: auto;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color | default: '#F5F3E7' }};
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:before,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding | default: 65 }}px 55px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 46% 54%;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy {
    max-width: 440px;
    padding-right: 28px;
  }

  /* Eyebrow text fades upward */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 17px;
    color: #777d5d;
    font: 500 10px/1.4 {{ block.settings.body_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(14px);
    transition: opacity 600ms ease 60ms,
                transform 600ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 60ms;
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* Main heading reveals line by line */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    margin: 0 0 19px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color | default: '#626B4C' }};
    font: 800 40px/1.05 {{ block.settings.heading_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading-line {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading-line-inner {
    display: block;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(105%);
    transition: opacity 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) calc(140ms + var(--line-idx, 0) * 130ms),
                transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) calc(140ms + var(--line-idx, 0) * 130ms);
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading-line-inner {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading h2,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__attribution p,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge-label p {
    margin: 0;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    letter-spacing: inherit;
  }

  /* Paragraphs appear with a staggered fade-in */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color | default: '#858575' }};
    font: 400 12px/1.65 {{ block.settings.body_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 650ms ease calc(380ms + var(--p-idx, 0) * 110ms),
                transform 650ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) calc(380ms + var(--p-idx, 0) * 110ms);
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* Brand signature appears last */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature {
    margin-top: 19px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(14px);
    transition: opacity 650ms ease 620ms,
                transform 650ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 620ms;
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color | default: '#626B4C' }};
    font: 700 12px/1.5 {{ block.settings.heading_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline {
    margin: 0;
    color: #777d5d;
    font: 400 10px/1.5 {{ block.settings.body_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
  }

  /* Value badges reveal sequentially */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @keyframes ai-story-badge-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.9);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge {
    min-height: 32px;
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: 0 1 auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #eae5d4;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #626b4c;
    font: 500 9px/1.2 {{ block.settings.body_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.9);
    will-change: opacity, transform;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    animation: ai-story-badge-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 550ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.3, 0.64, 1) calc(700ms + var(--badge-idx, 0) * 90ms) backwards;
    transition: transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 1, 0.3, 1),
                box-shadow 260ms ease,
                border-color 260ms ease;
  }

  /* Hover effect: Value badges scale to 1.03 */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(98, 107, 76, 0.12);
    border-color: #d8d2be;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge-label {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge-label p {
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex: 0 0 18px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #eae5d4;
    color: #626b4c;
    transition: transform 260ms ease;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge:hover .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    display: block;
  }

  /* RIGHT COLUMN: Image Collage */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual {
    min-width: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    min-height: 390px;
  }

  /* Main baby image reveals using a soft mask or clip transition */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 77%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height | default: 205 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_radius | default: 18 }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    clip-path: inset(0 0 20% 0 round {{ block.settings.image_radius | default: 18 }}px);
    transform: translateY(22px);
    transition: opacity 850ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 140ms,
                clip-path 900ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 140ms,
                transform 850ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 140ms,
                box-shadow 400ms ease;
    will-change: opacity, clip-path, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-wrap {
    opacity: 1;
    clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0 round {{ block.settings.image_radius | default: 18 }}px);
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: inherit;
    transform: scale(1);
    transition: transform 450ms cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  /* Hover: Images scale to 1.025 */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-wrap:hover .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo {
    transform: scale(1.025);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-wrap:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #eae5d4;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Secondary baby image enters with a subtle upward movement */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    top: 165px;
    left: 0;
    width: 43%;
    height: 225px;
    border: 5px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px);
    transition: opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 320ms,
                transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 320ms,
                box-shadow 400ms ease;
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small-wrap {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 7px;
    transform: scale(1);
    transition: transform 450ms cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  /* Hover: Images scale to 1.025 */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small-wrap:hover .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small {
    transform: scale(1.025);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small-wrap:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
  }

  /* Quote card fades in with a gentle scale transition */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote {
    position: absolute;
    top: 240px;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 44%;
    min-height: 150px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.quote_background | default: '#626B4C' }};
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(98, 107, 76, 0.16);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.92) translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 750ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 480ms,
                transform 750ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 480ms,
                box-shadow 350ms ease;
    will-change: opacity, transform;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
  }

  /* Hover: Quote card receives a very subtle elevation effect */
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.01);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(98, 107, 76, 0.28);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-mark {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e7b13a;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.9;
    transition: transform 300ms ease;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote:hover .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-mark {
    transform: scale(1.06) translateY(-1px);
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    color: #f5f3e7;
    font: 600 15px/1.4 {{ block.settings.heading_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__attribution {
    margin: 0;
    color: #eae5d4;
    font: 500 8px/1.4 {{ block.settings.body_font.family | default: 'Montserrat' }}, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 8px 8px;
    color: #626b4c;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Tablet Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
      padding: 48px 32px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy {
      padding-right: 18px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual {
      padding-left: 8px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges {
      gap: 5px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge {
      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage {
      min-height: 340px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-wrap {
      height: 175px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small-wrap {
      top: 142px;
      height: 195px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote {
      top: 205px;
      min-height: 132px;
      padding: 13px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  /* Mobile Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
      padding: 42px 22px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy,
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual {
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
